Source and scope of changes
---------------------------
This LICENSE is the original BSD-3-Clause text from python-semver
(https://github.com/python-semver/python-semver), base commit
a4b7d337b1eb699ad4bad532a4b3fc68f8ec2408, Copyright (c) 2013 Konstantine
Rybnikov and contributors.

The files under src/semver/ are that upstream package with one localized
change in version.py (Version.compare reads the existing __slots__ values
directly instead of rebuilding them through to_tuple()/properties). No other
source file was modified. The full change is patch.diff.
